OL,3,GNEWSAPolice attend anti-migrant protest
OL,4,Ain coastal town
OL,5,
OL,6,FProtesters gathered on Dorset's south
OL,7,Fcoast in the wake of a major
OL,8,Fanti-migrant protest in Portsmouth.
OL,10,FDorset Police said it received a report
OL,11,Fat 10:27 BST on Sunday of a protest in
OL,12,Fthe area of Lake Drive in Poole, which
OL,13,Fmoved to West Quay Road.
OL,15,FIt said officers attended to make sure
OL,16,Fpeople could "protest legally and
OL,17,Fsafely without causing significant or
OL,18,Fongoing disruption", and no offences or
OL,19,Fdisorder had been reported.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
